            "title": "盤中速報 - 伊魯米納(ILMN-US)大漲5.03%，報277.89美元",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>伊魯米納(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:ILMN:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/ILMN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">ILMN-US</a>)截至台北時間10日03:54股價上漲13.32美元，報277.89美元，漲幅5.03%，成交量1,373,474（股），盤中最高價277.90美元、最低價265.25美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：+0.83%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：+0.58%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：+0.64%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-0.48%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>伊魯米納(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:ILMN:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/ILMN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">ILMN-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：-0.43%</li> <li>近 1 月：+25.35%</li> <li>近 3 月：+40.87%</li> <li>近 6 月：+106.7%</li> <li>今年以來：+101.72%</li></ul></section></main>",
